{"id":"c7bfa0375f35877e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-decider.md","title":"Decider","display":"df-decider — Decider","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-decider","aliases":["28-df-decider","Decider"],"display":"df-decider — Decider","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-language]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-decider"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-decider</span><span>Decider</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decider — Decider"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae06e9e85361e995\" href=\"?note=ae06e9e85361e995\" title=\"28-df-language\">28-df-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M),\\operatorname{Halt}_M\">\\(L(M),\\operatorname{Halt}_M\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非成员输入最终停于拒绝态，因为确定型转移在所有非停机状态上总定义。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"ae06e9e85361e995","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$L(M),\\operatorname{Halt}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"L(M),\\operatorname{Halt}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x).","display":true}],"bytes":825,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count"